%N A400715 Number of 9-regular labeled graphs on 2n nodes.
%H A400715 Élie de Panafieu, <a href="/A400715/b400715.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..60</a>
%H A400715 Emma Caizergues and Élie de Panafieu, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5817/CZ.MUNI.EUROCOMB23-035">Exact enumeration of graphs and bipartite graphs with degree constraints</a>, Proceedings of EUROCOMB'23, 254-262.
%H A400715 Élie de Panafieu, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.12459">Asymptotic expansion of regular and connected regular graphs</a>, arXiv:2408.12459 [math.CO], 2024. See Proposition 3.
%F A400715 See Caizergues and de Panafieu (2023) for an exact formula.
%o A400715 (PARI) \\ Needs GraphsByDegreeSeq from links in A295193.
%o A400715 a(n)={my(M=GraphsByDegreeSeq(2*n, 9, (p, r)->9-valuation(p, x) <= r)); if(n>=5, vecsum(M[, 2]), n==0)}
%Y A400715 Alternating terms of column k=9 of A059441.
%Y A400715 Cf. A014381 (connected unlabeled case).
%K A400715 nonn,new
%O A400715 0,7
%A A400715 _Élie de Panafieu_, Oct 04 2026
